/* ConnectionFailure.swift */
"The server requires an L2TP tunnel secret." = "服务器要求 L2TP 隧道密钥。";
"Servers that require a tunnel secret are not supported yet. Ask your network administrator how to connect." = "当前版本还不支持带隧道密钥的服务器，请联系网络管理员确认接入方式。";
"The server rejected this account." = "服务器拒绝了这个账户。";
"Check the username and password in Connection settings (they are case-sensitive). If you changed your password recently, enter it again." = "请到「连接设置」核对用户名和口令，注意区分大小写；口令刚改过的话需要重新填写。";
"The VPN server could not be found." = "找不到这台 VPN 服务器。";
