"The server did not respond and the connection timed out." = "服务器没有响应，连接超时。";
"Make sure the server address and port are correct and that this network can reach the server. Some public networks block UDP port 1701, which L2TP uses." = "请确认服务器地址和端口正确，并且当前网络允许访问它；部分公共网络会拦截 L2TP 使用的 UDP 1701 端口。";
"The network is unreachable; the server can't be reached." = "网络不可达，无法到达服务器。";
"Check this Mac's network connection, or try again on a different network." = "请检查这台 Mac 的网络连接，或换一个网络后重试。";
"The server refused the connection." = "服务器拒绝了连接请求。";
"Make sure the port is correct, and ask your network administrator whether the service is running." = "请确认端口填写正确，并向网络管理员确认服务是否开启。";
"Couldn't create the VPN network interface: insufficient privileges." = "创建 VPN 网络接口失败，权限不足。";
"Connect again and complete administrator authorization in the system dialog." = "请重新连接，并在系统弹出的窗口里完成管理员授权。";
"Couldn't set up subnet routes." = "设置网段路由失败。";
"Check the subnets under Subnets and make sure they don't conflict with this Mac's current network." = "请到「内网网段」检查填写的网段，确认它们没有和本机现有网络冲突。";
"The server closed the connection." = "服务器主动断开了连接。";
"The session may have expired or been limited by the server. Try again later, and contact your network administrator if it keeps failing." = "可能是会话过期或服务器侧的限制，稍后重试；如果一直失败请联系网络管理员。";
"The VPN backend quit unexpectedly." = "VPN 后端意外退出。";
"Try again. If it still fails, send the contents of the Log to your network administrator." = "请重试一次；如果仍然失败，把「运行日志」里的内容发给网络管理员。";
"See the Log for details." = "详细过程见「运行日志」。";

